│                                                                  │
│   E  Honor Retry-After when the sync worker backs off after a    │
│      429                                                         │
│                                                                  │
│   ────────────────────────── ↑ 4 more ────────────────────────── │
│   - Read `Retry-After` (seconds or an HTTP date) from the        │
│   `429` response                                                 │
│   - Wait at least that long, then go back to the doubling delay  │
│   - Cap the wait at `MAX_DELAY`                                  │
│                                                                  │
│   **Where:** `src/sync.sh`, `src/config.sh`                      │
│                                                                  │
│   **Done when:** a `429` with `Retry-After: 30` makes the        │
│   worker wait 30 seconds before its next try.                    │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                                                                  │
